96
00:07:04,447 --> 00:07:08,784
<i>Wait, wait, Maestro! Oh,</i>
<i>Maestro, please, please stop!</i>

97
00:07:10,187 --> 00:07:12,855
<i>Oh, wait, Maestro.</i>
<i>Maestro!</i>

98
