We can follow it.

228
00:15:17,484 --> 00:15:18,651
Or we can flail about.

229
00:15:21,755 --> 00:15:24,423
I'll take your silence as a
vote for the former. Onward.

230
00:15:24,490 --> 00:15:26,425
At the culmination of mass,
a mechanical dove,

231
00:15:26,493 --> 00:15:28,761
